Error [E0109]: Text values `first` and `last` aren't joined with `+`
  --> string_plus.jet:4:14
    |
  4 |     full :: (first + last)
    |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: There's one way to build text: interpolation (S8)
 Fix: Write the pieces inside one string: "{first}{last}"
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0109
